{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Lighthouse Is My Home is a dynamic roguelite in which you play as a lighthouse keeper. A mysterious island full of dangers, events and secrets awaits you. Explore, die, revive again, but don't let the lighthouse fire go out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/tlimh_2_battle.gif?t=1742590615\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Lighthouse Is My Home, you are the lighthouse keeper on a cursed island where everything is constantly changing in the fog. Set out to explore forgotten territories, harness the power of ancient artifacts by creating synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/tlimh_3_chill.gif?t=1742590615\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return to the lighthouse with valuable loot to become stronger! New events will be waiting for you every day. Have pirates landed on the island? Have you decided to become a gladiator to earn money? Did a merchant ship crash? Make your own destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/tlimh_4_lighthouse.gif?t=1742590615\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371460?t=1742590615","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371460?t=1742590615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/53b56b5fd2f3455a9f41777c0f1d550930afc87b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742590615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/53b56b5fd2f3455a9f41777c0f1d550930afc87b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742590615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"descripti